{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Therefore the speakers say.</b> Balaam and Beor his father, whom Sihon hired to curse Moab — Tanhuma." "<b>Come to Heshbon.</b> Come to dwell within Heshbon, for now it will be established, since it is now under Sihon's rule; in the time when it was in the hand of the king of Moab, they were afraid to dwell in it, because the king was weak." "<b>It shall be built and established.</b> More than it had been already." "<b>City of Sihon.</b> A city that is now under Sihon's rule."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:08.299222494Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}